Package: brightness-control
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Sarthak <sarthakkumar766@gmail.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libxapp1, ddcutil
Description: Tray slider for external monitor brightness
 Adds a system tray icon with a brightness slider that controls an
 external monitor over DDC/CI using ddcutil. Starts automatically on login.
